sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant Edge as Edge
    participant Chat as Chat service
    participant Safe as Safety classifier
    participant Inf as Inference
    participant Store as Conversation store
    U->>Edge: prompt
    Edge->>Chat: authenticated, quota checked
    Chat->>Safe: screen the input
    alt blocked
        Safe-->>U: refused, with a reason
    else allowed
        Chat->>Store: load the context window
        Chat->>Inf: generate
        loop streaming
            Inf-->>Safe: check the partial output
            Safe-->>Chat: clear
            Chat-->>U: stream the token
        end
        Chat->>Store: persist the turn
    end
    Note over Safe: the classifier is on the request path, so its latency is your latency
